Dianne Carter.\
Maile Duval\
Rusty Martin\
Tulsa\
\
Walter watched the entire manoeuvre from a distance of one metre and filed it away for the rest of his life.\
Walter gave him the poster.\
The High Elvis unrolled it against the balustrade. It was the Rock Against Revival bill, a fortnight old, four thousand names down the back of it in six-point type, and one of them was his.\
He signed it across the top, and he handed it back, and he said, \'93Thank you very much,\'94 and then he was gone with the rest of them out into the Ghetto.\
Walter stood there and looked at the signature for a while.\
It was the same one.\

